+# TLS backend
+
+No TLS backend decision is currently recorded for this project, so none is stated here. The only recorded decisions that touch on TLS concern how it is used, not which implementation provides it: HTTPS is used everywhere with no exceptions, and certificate verification is enabled on all builds. Until a decision on the backend is recorded, this policy sets no value for it.
